{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24798","headline":"唐昌观玉蘂花折有仙人游怅然成二绝 二 · 严休复","name":"唐昌观玉蘂花折有仙人游怅然成二绝 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽车潜下玉龟山，尘世何由覩蕣颜。\n唯有多情枝上雪，好风吹缀绿云鬟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严休复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24798.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24798","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}